.SH "Typedef Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "typedef \fBvoid\fP *(* GLFWallocatefun) (size_t \fBsize\fP, \fBvoid\fP *user)"

.PP
The function pointer type for memory allocation callbacks\&. This is the function pointer type for memory allocation callbacks\&. A memory allocation callback function has the following signature: 
.PP
.nf
void* function_name(size_t size, void* user)

.fi
.PP
.PP
This function must return either a memory block at least \fRsize\fP bytes long, or \fRNULL\fP if allocation failed\&. Note that not all parts of GLFW handle allocation failures gracefully yet\&.
.PP
This function must support being called during \fBglfwInit\fP but before the library is flagged as initialized, as well as during \fBglfwTerminate\fP after the library is no longer flagged as initialized\&.
.PP
Any memory allocated via this function will be deallocated via the same allocator during library termination or earlier\&.
.PP
Any memory allocated via this function must be suitably aligned for any object type\&. If you are using C99 or earlier, this alignment is platform-dependent but will be the same as what \fRmalloc\fP provides\&. If you are using C11 or later, this is the value of \fRalignof(max_align_t)\fP\&.
.PP
The size will always be greater than zero\&. Allocations of size zero are filtered out before reaching the custom allocator\&.
.PP
If this function returns \fRNULL\fP, GLFW will emit \fBGLFW_OUT_OF_MEMORY\fP\&.
.PP
This function must not call any GLFW function\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIsize\fP The minimum size, in bytes, of the memory block\&. 
.br
\fIuser\fP The user-defined pointer from the allocator\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The address of the newly allocated memory block, or \fRNULL\fP if an error occurred\&.
.RE
.PP
@pointer_lifetime The returned memory block must be valid at least until it is deallocated\&.
.PP
@reentrancy This function should not call any GLFW function\&.
.PP
@thread_safety This function must support being called from any thread that calls GLFW functions\&.
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBinit_allocator\fP 
.PP
\fBGLFWallocator\fP
.RE
.PP
\fBSince\fP
.RS 4
Added in version 3\&.4\&. 
.RE
.PP

.SS "typedef \fBstruct\fP GLFWallocator GLFWallocator"

.PP
